  "prefLabel": "Res 7802.07 Previous Offenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 7802.07 Previous Offenses. If a person has not committed the same offense in 7 years, the next offense shall be considered as a first offense.\n\nSource. #10534, eff 3-1-14\n\nAPPENDIX",
